  "bodyHash": "oe05yGlsue0=",
  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態樹木</a>&nbsp;| <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></span></h2><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/910/506/quark.png\" alt=\"標題圖片\" width=\"1176\" height=\"480\"></h5><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/A4FCBS3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Prkr13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>概述</strong></h2><p style=\"text-align:left\">此模組讓 Quark 與動態樹木相容，為該模組新增的樹木加入動態生長的版本，並在世界生成時完全取代它們。<br>樹木的行為與生成可以透過樹木資源包進行自訂與調整。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>功能</strong></h2><h4><strong>包含的樹木</strong></h4><h5>(1.20.1)</h5><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">烈焰喇叭花</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">霜凍喇叭花</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">寧靜喇叭花</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">陽光喇叭花</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">溫暖喇叭花</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">灰燼樹</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">發光蘑菇（當安裝動態樹木+時）&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul><h5>(1.16.5 / 1.18.2)</h5><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">烈焰花</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">霜凍花</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">寧靜花</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">陽光花</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">甜蜜花</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">溫暖花</span></li>\n</ul><h5>(1.12.2)</h5><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">開花樹</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">沼澤橡樹</span></li>\n</ul><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4><strong>Quark 的杜鵑花</strong></h4><h5>(1.18.2)</h5><p>使用此附加組件後，杜鵑花樹將使用 Quark 的杜鵑花原木，並且會掉落更多原木以使其更實用。</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/910/501/image.png\" alt=\"杜鵑花樹\" width=\"1206\" height=\"942\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>世界生成</strong></h4><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">動態 Quark 樹木會在世界中生成。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">生成的杜鵑花樹也會帶有 Quark 的杜鵑花木材。<br></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">在 1.12.2 版本中，由於 Quark 的設定，附加組件無法自行停用非動態樹木的生成。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\">這可以透過在 Quark 設定中停用開花樹和沼澤樹來輕鬆解決。&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>其他附加組件</strong></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">其他模組的動態樹木附加組件可以在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 動態樹木的 CurseForge 頁面</a>找到。<br></span></p><h4><strong>建議與請求</strong></h4><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">若要請求新增相容模組，請在此處提出！！&nbsp;<br><a href=\"https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions</a><br></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>需求</strong></h2><p>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態樹木<br></a>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"><strong>授權條款與模組包</strong></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>你可以將此模組用於任何你想要的模組包中！無需詢問。<br>此模組採用 <strong>MIT</strong> 授權，其原始碼公開於 GitHub。</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
